<title>USA: Ingles Markets president retired Dec 28.</title>
<headline>Ingles Markets president retired Dec 28.</headline>
<dateline>ASHEVILLE, N.C. 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ingles Markets Inc said Monday that Landy Laney, director and executive officer of the company since 1972 and president and chief operating officer since 1982, retired effective December 28, 1996.  </p>
<p>The company said in a release that Vaughn Fisher, vice president and sales manager, will replace Laney as president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Fisher joined Ingles Markets in 1972 and has been a director since 1985, the company added.</p>
